  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/us+measles+cases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">US measles cases</a> in 2026 have already outpaced last year's total and have reached a level not seen in more than three decades.The US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention reported a total of 2,318 confirmed infections on Friday, passing last year's total of 2,289 cases and hitting the highest level since 1991.Forty-three states and Washington, DC, have recorded at least one infection this year.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Vaccine policy under the Trump administration has been upended since critic Robert F. Kennedy Jr became secretary of Health and Human Services.During Kennedy's tenure, thousands of career scientists at the CDC have been fired and funding for local health departments has been frozen, said Rich Besser, the former acting director of the CDC.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675367/Bloomberg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bloomberg</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Jul 25, 2026 at 07:09 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Jul 25, 2026 at 07:09 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n            